#. +> trunk5
#: scanparams.cpp:620
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<emphasis strong=\"1\">No scanner found, or unable to access it</emphasis><nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"There was a problem using the SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) library to access the scanner device.  There may be a problem with your SANE installation, or it may not be configured to support your scanner.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Check that SANE is correctly installed and configured on your system, and also that the scanner device name and settings are correct.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"See the SANE project home page (<link url=\"http://www.sane-project.org\">www.sane-project.org</link>) for more information on SANE installation and setup."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis strong=\"1\">Non se atopou ningún escáner, ou non se pode acceder ao escáner indicado.</emphasis><nl/>"
" <nl/>"
" Produciuse un problema durante o uso da biblioteca SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) para acceder ao dispositivo de escanear. Pode que exista un problema de instalación de SANE, ou pode que a biblioteca non estea configura para ser compatíbel co seu escáner.<nl/>"
" <nl/>"
" Comprobe que SANE estea instalado e configurado correctamente, e que o nome e a configuración do dispositivo de escanear son correctas.<nl/>"
" <nl/>"
" Consulte o sitio web do proxecto SANE (<link url=\"http://www.sane-project.org\">www.sane-project.org</link>) para obter máis información sobre a instalación e configuración de SANE."

